/P 540 0 R
/T (For Kuwait/GCC patients and caregivers, ISTSEH makes medication care safer and easier through reminders, personalized scheduling, safety warnings, and family support. This is especially important in Kuwait, where chronic disease burden is high: diabetes affects about 25.6% of adults, and 73.3% of adults are overweight or obese, increasing the need for organized long-term medication care.)
